:: reebok-neck-wordmark {"position": "2225,475", "size": "100,100"}
Is the Wordmark logo a patch or stitched directly?

On Reebok Edge Authentic jerseys, the logo should be a patch, with the backing material being the same color as the jersey itself (in most cases). The logo should sit level and centered on the neck.

[[Patch ->reebok-laces-ask]] 
